          "sha256": "4b11fc8e1aca4f13a41bf894c5d239325e859d5d563f251d80675d7a57d4e029",
          "behavior": "Both endpoints require authenticated user ID. PATCH updates that user questionnaire; completion permits an empty body, calls MarkUserOnboarded for that ID and returns userToResponse. Original completion timestamp is preserved by COALESCE."
